== 15. the human cannot own a task
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Review this", "due_minutes": 5, "kind": "task", "submission_id": "submission-9", "to": "human", "token": "<token-1>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "error": "The human cannot own a task. Address it to a member"
}

== 16. a handoff to the human is refused
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Yours", "kind": "handoff", "reply_to": 2, "submission_id": "submission-10", "to": "Human", "token": "<token-2>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "error": "The human cannot own a task. Address it to a member"
}

== 17. a member cannot post a deprecate message
-> {"action": "post", "body": "Drop it.", "kind": "deprecate", "reply_to": 2, "submission_id": "submission-11", "token": "<token-2>", "workspace": "<workspace-1>"}
<- {
  "error": "Invalid bridge arguments"
}

